cytotoxic nucleotide to avoid its genomic integration (PubMed:33833118)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}